WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Review precise suggestions beside the source and PDF.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Shift+A accepts each edit. No compilation needed.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Compile once to update the PDF.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Compare the current draft with the start of the session.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Deleted text is struck out. New text is underlined.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
See the reason for the change, right beside the paper.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Read the revised text without the deletion markup.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Inspect the precise source changes, including LaTeX.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Save your draft, then return to a clean home screen.
